  "goodToKnow": "Der Ökonom (die Ökonomin) is an economist; the more German word is der Wirtschaftswissenschaftler. It's a weak noun: den Ökonomen. Germany's Sachverständigenrat, five economists nicknamed die Wirtschaftsweisen (the economic wise men), advises the government. Die Ökonomie means economy or economics, and ökonomisch economic. Don't confuse it with Ökologie (ecology). Plural: die Ökonomen."
